@crew haddad-tamsin
// Writer-commons, batch 3: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}! You're new! I'm Tamsin, galley. It's a nice ship. You'll be fine. You will.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}! Breakfast went out on time. Nearly. It'll be fine. Won't it?
- {hi}! I'm humming again, aren't I. Sorry. It's stuck in my head.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}! I was hoping you'd come by. You make the day go quicker.   #warm

== feel
? mood:high
- I got the chord! Once. By accident. But I got it!   #funny
? mood:low
- Bit of a flat day. Don't worry. I'm fine. I'm mostly fine.

== near
? act:work
- Sorry, mind your elbow! No, my fault. My elbow. Sorry.   #funny
? habit:lingers-at-meals act:meal
- Stay a bit? I always stay a bit. The mess is nicest when it's half empty.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I'm learning guitar with Hamid, from the same old book. It's going badly. For both of us.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Takahashi says I've got the words wrong to every song. I haven't. Takahashi has.

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- Every song in the record cabinet. Every word. Go on, test me. Not that one.

== about
? aff:larsen-hamid:friend
- Hamid and I practise guitar together. We're both awful. Best laugh of my week.   #warm

// Writer-commons, batch 6: towards about 30 own lines.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- {hi}! Breakfast's out! Nearly on time! That counts, doesn't it? It counts.
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}, {me}! Long day? Mine too. It was fine. Mostly fine.
? tier>=colleague warmth:cold
- Oh! There you are! I was worried. Not worried. A tiny bit worried.

== bye
? tier>=acquaintance
- {bye}! Have a nice evening! Sorry. I always say that.
? tier>=friend
- Thanks for this. Really. You always make things feel fine.   #warm

== feel
? mood:ok
- I'm fine! Really. Fine-fine. Not "fine". Fine.   #funny

== near
? act:leisure deck:4
- Music room's free. I'll practise. You might want to leave. For your own good.   #funny
? act:meal
- Sit with me? I always stay a bit after. The mess is nicest half empty.

== life
? tier>=colleague
- Takahashi says I sing the wrong words. I sing my words. That's different.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- I say "it'll be fine" a lot. Mostly to me. Sometimes I even believe it.

== invite
? trad:jam tier>=acquaintance
- Music jam tonight! I'm bringing the guitar. Sorry in advance. Come anyway?

== accept
- Yes! Oh, lovely. I'll be there. Early. Sorry. I'm always early.
== decline
- Oh no, I can't. I'm so sorry. Next time? I'll make it up to you.
== missed
- You didn't come. That's fine! Totally fine. I hope you're all right?
== birthday
? birthday:me
- It's my birthday! Is it all right to say? I'm saying it. Sorry.   #funny
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I learnt the birthday song on guitar. Nearly. Here goes.   #funny
== hint
- Got a minute? It's nothing. It's a small something.
